    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Independent brand, website and software design studio in New York, founded 2015 and led hands-on by David McGillivray (British, Brighton University; D&AD New Blood Graphite Pencil 2011 for a Taschen iPad app). Clients are mostly tech startups: Infinite Machine (all EV web design since the P1 launch), Tolan by Portola (AI companion brand + app icon + site), Americana (NFC collectibles marketplace), Sandbar, Evara, Groth; plus in-house software ventures (Archiv, Hedroom). Seniority: senior, creative-director level, 17 to 18 years; led design in-house at tech startups and fashion brands before going independent, and taught interaction design at Parsons. Autonomy 5: has run his own practice for about 10 years, working directly with founders (inferred, no first-hand evidence). Size 1: solo-led, the site says specialist collaborators join per project. Work Status Studio: site and LinkedIn agree. Instagram: @dmcgco does not exist; an unconfirmed @davidbigmcgill surfaced, left empty. He is active on X as @dmcgco.",
